{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37556","headline":"寄献湖州从叔员外 · 郑谷","name":"寄献湖州从叔员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顾渚山边郡，溪将罨画通。\n远看城郭里，全在水云中。\n西阁归何晚，东吴兴未穷。\n茶香紫笋露，洲迥白苹风。\n歌缓眉低翠，杯明蜡翦红。\n政成寻往事，辍棹问渔翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}